  "name": "Fix ChatInputBox layout sticky footer",
  "pinned": false,
  "description": "# Conversation Summary\n\n1. **Issue Identified**: ChatInputBox positioning problem where popup elements (IntelliSense, modals) were not appearing above the input box as expected.\n\n2. **Root Cause**: ChatMessageList used a flex column layout that didn't guarantee the input stayed at the bottom or allowed popups to appear properly above it.\n\n3. **Solution Implemented**: Restructured ChatMessageList.vue to use a \"sticky footer\" pattern with a scrollable messages container and fixed footer section.\n\n4. **Layout Changes**: Separated the component into two distinct areas - `flex-1 overflow-y-auto` for scrollable messages and `shrink-0` for the fixed composer footer with proper z-index layering.\n\n5. **Result**: ChatInputBox now permanently stays at the bottom while all popup elements (IntelliSense, dropdowns) properly render above it with correct stacking order using `z-50`.",
