      "task_item": "",
      "content": "I'll analyze the current structure and fix the layout so the ChatInputBox stays at the bottom while popup elements (IntelliSense, modals) appear above it.\n\n## Changes Required\n\nThe issue is that ChatMessageList has a flex column layout that doesn't guarantee the input stays at the bottom. We need to restructure ChatMessageList to use a \"sticky footer\" pattern.\n\n| File | Changes |\n|------|---------|\n| ChatMessageList.vue | Restructure layout: messages in scrollable container, input box in fixed footer |\n| ChatInputBox.vue | No changes needed |\n| Chat.vue | Minor ref adjustments if needed |\n\nLet me implement the fix:\n\n```vue src/components/chat/ChatMessageList.vue\n<script setup>\nimport ChatEntry from '@/components/ChatEntry.vue'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"w-full h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n    \n    <!-- Scrollable Messages Container -->\n    <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto min-h-0\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[860px] mx-auto flex flex-col px-4 py-6\">\n\n        <!-- \u2500\u2500 Message Blocks \u2500\u2500 -->\n        <template v-for=\"(message, ix) in messages\" :key=\"message.doc_id || message.id\">\n          <div\n            :class=\"[\n              'group/block relative',\n              isNewSpeaker(message, ix) ? 'mt-6' : 'mt-0.5',\n            ]\"\n          >\n            <ChatEntry\n              :chat=\"chat\"\n              :message=\"message\"\n              :mentionList=\"mentionList\"\n              :menu-less=\"readOnly\"\n              :usersList=\"usersList\"\n              :isNewSpeaker=\"isNewSpeaker(message, ix)\"\n              @edited=\"$emit('edited', $event)\"\n              @enhance=\"$emit('enhance', message)\"\n              @remove=\"$emit('remove', message)\"\n              @remove-file=\"$emit('remove-file', { message, file: $event })\"\n              @hide=\"$emit('hide', message)\"\n              @answer=\"$emit('answer', message)\"\n              @run-edit=\"$emit('run-edit', $event)\"\n              @copy=\"$emit('copy', message)\"\n              @add-file-to-chat=\"$emit('add-file-to-chat', $event)\"\n              @image=\"$emit('image', { ...$event, readonly: true })\"\n              @generate-code=\"$emit('generate-code', $event)\"\n              @reload-file=\"$emit('reload-file', $event)\"\n              @open-file=\"$emit('open-file', $event)\"\n              @save-file=\"$emit('save-file', $event)\"\n              @add-file=\"$emit('add-file', $event)\"\n              @edit-message=\"$emit('edit-message', $event)\"\n              @code-file-shown.stop=\"$emit('code-file-shown', $event)\"\n              @thread=\"$emit('thread', $event)\"\n              @sub-task=\"$emit('sub-task', $event)\"\n              @message-changed=\"$emit('message-changed', $event)\"\n              @run-agents=\"$emit('run-agents', $event)\"\n              @preview-file=\"$emit('preview-file', $event)\"\n              @search-files=\"$emit('search-files', $event)\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </template>\n\n        <!-- Scroll anchor -->\n        <div class=\"h-4\" ref=\"anchor\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Fixed Footer: Composer Section -->\n    <div v-if=\"!readOnly\" class=\"shrink-0 bg-base-100 border-t border-base-300/30\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-[860px] mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5\">\n\n        <!-- IntelliSense dropdown \u2014 appears above composer -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-50\">\n          <slot name=\"intellisense\" />\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- The input box itself -->\n        <slot name=\"input\" />\n\n        <!-- Attached files row \u2014 below composer -->\n        <slot name=\"files\" />\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: [\n    'chat',\n    'messages',\n    'editMessage',\n    'mentionList',\n    'readOnly',\n    'usersList',\n    'childrenChats',\n  ],\n  emits: [\n    'edited',\n    'enhance',\n    'remove',\n    'remove-file',\n    'hide',\n    'answer',\n    'run-edit',\n    'copy',\n    'add-file-to-chat',\n    'image',\n    'generate-code',\n    'reload-file',\n    'open-file',\n    'save-file',\n    'add-file',\n    'edit-message',\n    'code-file-shown',\n    'thread',\n    'sub-task',\n    'set-active-chat',\n    'message-changed',\n    'run-agents',\n    'search-files',\n    'preview-file',\n  ],\n  computed: {\n    isVibe() {\n      return this.chat.mode === 'vibe'\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    scrollToBottom() {\n      setTimeout(() => this.$refs.anchor?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' }), 200)\n    },\n    isNewSpeaker(message, ix) {\n      if (ix === 0) return true\n      const prev = this.messages[ix - 1]\n      return prev.role !== message.role || prev.user !== message.user\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n\u2705 **ChatMessageList.vue**\n- Changed main container from `flex flex-col` to explicit `h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden`\n- Split layout into two sections:\n  1. **Scrollable messages** (`flex-1 overflow-y-auto min-h-0`) - takes remaining space\n  2. **Fixed footer** (`shrink-0`) - stays at bottom with border-top separator\n- Moved composer block (input box, intellisense, files) into fixed footer section\n- Added `z-50` to intellisense to float above input box\n- Added `bg-base-100 border-t border-base-300/30` styling to footer for visual separation\n\n**Result:** \n- \u2705 Messages scroll naturally\n- \u2705 ChatInputBox always stays at bottom\n- \u2705 IntelliSense dropdown appears above input box\n- \u2705 All popups render on top of composer\n- \u2705 No overflow issues",
